---
import "@/styles/motion.css";
---

<figure class="visual-rise border-4 border-rule bg-secondary-background shadow-[8px_8px_0_var(--rule)]">
    <figcaption class="border-b-4 border-rule px-4 py-2 text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-link uppercase">
        Four judged areas, equal weight
    </figcaption>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2">
        <div class="border-r-4 border-b-4 border-rule p-3 sm:p-4">
            <p class="font-heading text-2xl leading-none font-extrabold">25%</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold">Core Values</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs opacity-70">How the team works together.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b-4 border-rule p-3 sm:p-4">
            <p class="font-heading text-2xl leading-none font-extrabold">25%</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold">Robot Design</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs opacity-70">The robot and the code.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-r-4 border-rule p-3 sm:p-4">
            <p class="font-heading text-2xl leading-none font-extrabold">25%</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold">Innovation Project</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs opacity-70">The problem and the solution.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 sm:p-4">
            <p class="font-heading text-2xl leading-none font-extrabold">25%</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold">Robot Game</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs opacity-70">Three matches on the field.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="border-t-4 border-rule px-4 py-3 text-sm">
        A qualifier scores each area the same. A middle-of-the-pack robot can
        advance on a strong project and clear explanations.
    </p>
</figure>
